guration">Verify kubectl configuration<a class=3D"td-heading-self-link" hre=
f=3D"https://kubernetes.io/docs/tasks/tools/install-kubectl-linux/#verify-k=
ubectl-configuration" aria-label=3D"Heading self-link"></a></h2><p>In order=
 for kubectl to find and access a Kubernetes cluster, it needs a
