r/share/bash-completion/bash_completion
</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Reload your shell and verify that bash-=
completion is correctly installed by typing <code>type _init_completion</co=
de>.</p><h3 id=3D"enable-kubectl-autocompletion">Enable kubectl autocomplet=
